sequenceDiagram
  participant R as Gateway router
  participant P as Policy engine
  participant V as vLLM pool - self-hosted
  participant A as Vertex AI
  participant X as External API
  R->>P: request class: tier-2 task, privacy: standard
  P->>R: chain: self-hosted, fallback vertex
  R->>V: Try primary
  alt pool saturated or A3 capacity constrained
    V-->>R: 429 / queue too deep
    R->>A: Overflow to Vertex AI same model family
    A-->>R: Response - billed per token at list
  else healthy
    V-->>R: Response at fleet cost
  end
  alt Vertex also failing - circuit open
    R->>X: Last resort: external API
    X-->>R: Response
  end
  R->>R: Log cost, provider, degradation path
